## Changes made for TGM Stocks

- The analysis pipeline runs on the device inside an embedded Python runtime
  (Chaquopy) instead of on a server, and the Web UI is rendered in a WebView.
- The Android build uses `android/app/requirements-android.txt`, an Android
  variant of `requirements.txt`; the differences are documented in that file.
- `data_provider/akshare_fetcher.py` and `src/search_service.py` fall back to
  inline execution when `Process.start()` fails, because Android cannot spawn
  processes.
- The app identity (name, package id, icon, version) and the Android build
  files under `android/` are new.

